%%footer SPUDS 2026-03-26
%%scale 0.75
X:0K:T:SPUDS - March 26, 2026
T:Fearless Leaders Enid Diamante & Judy Kleppel%%begintext
REELS:

1.	F-Bomb (D) / Pretty Little Dog (Am) / Kitchen Girl with Kitchen Girl Harmony (A/Am)

2.	Du Pop a Ars (G) / The Dining Table (Am) /  (Balance – y A’s and/or B’s)

3.	Nail That Catfish to a Tree (G) / Red Haired Boy (A)/  Fisher’s Hornpipe (D) 

4.	Fiddle School (D) / Reign of Love (Em) 

5.	Cockle Shells (F) / Goff Hall (A)  English-y

6.	Round the Horn (G) / Bill’s French Tune (Dm) / Grumbling Old Man/Growling Old Woman (Am) /  Rousing 

7.	The Chickadee Polka (G) / BallyDesmond polka #2 (Ador)

8.	Dennis Murphy’s Polka (D) / Quarry Cross (Em) / Meeting of the Waters (A)

9.	Road to California (D) / Shenandoah Falls (A)

10. After the Battle of Aughrim (Am) / Robertson’s Reel (D) / The Wren (Bm)

11. Hunting the Buffalo (G) / Spootiskerry (G) / Brenda Stubberts (Am)

JIGS:

12. Tooth Fairy (G) / Scarce O’Tatties (Am) / Maison De Glace (D)  (smooth jigs)

13. Idlewild Jig (D) / Four Potatoes (Gmix) / Over the Causeway (A) 

14. Spring Fever (Em) / Out on the Ocean (G) / Cliffs of Moher (Am)

15. Da Shaalds of Foula (G) / Bert Ferguson (A)

WALTZ:

16. Sunday River Waltz (F)

17. Farewell to Winter (D)

%%endtext%%newpage
